      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "当方、普段は裏稼業で糊口をしのぐ身だが、\n此度は、金銭と関係なく、自らの技を試したい。\n『セピエンテは刺されず２度刺す』と称されし\n我が秘伝。見切れると思いし御仁は挑戦あれ。",
        "official_en": "I usually eke out a living doing other people's dirty\nwork. But today I'm challenging you just because I\nwant to test my mettle. Sepente strikes twice, but is\nnever struck—that's what they say about me.",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "UNREVIEWED"
      }
    },
